OL,3,ARyanair says it may freeze workers' pay
OL,4,Aand raise airfares
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyanair is considering a temporary wage
OL,7,Ffreeze for staff and confirmed airfares
OL,8,Fwill be "materially higher" next summer
OL,9,Fbecause of a sharp rise in fuel costs
OL,10,Ffollowing the US-Israel war with Iran.
OL,12,FThe airline said it expects fuel prices
OL,13,Fto remain high "well into 2027" unless
OL,14,Fthere is a "swift resolution" to the
OL,15,Fconflict.
OL,17,FRyanair said its fuel bill is forecast
OL,18,Fto be bB,2bn (#1.6bn) higher in the
OL,19,Fshort-term and its boss, Michael
OL,20,FO'Leary, said airfares would have to
OL,21,Frise by "double-digits" to help cover
OL,22,Fthe cost.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
