OL,3,ARyanair says it may freeze workers' pay
OL,4,Aand raise airfares
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the firm said that was unlikely to
OL,7,Fbe enough and it is looking into pay
OL,8,Ffreezes. Unite, the union representing
OL,9,FRyanair staff, said it had not been
OL,10,Ftold of "any such proposals".
